{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_919.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"7442690f0b36934eb930b3cd3e7a26d48de6c0474b4fa7fcfda207358bd22a72","ja":"ねえ、真美ちゃん、\nもう少し突き放す感じでできるかな？","zh":"那个，真美，能不能表现得再疏远一点？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_919.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"4a03be82f6df7dbb849af9e57a5d873374214ec31117e0cce58723d7cba25be5","ja":"へっ！？\nう、うん。やってみる……。","zh":"哈！？  \n嗯、嗯。我试试看……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_919.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"6ecac08ae622de237034704b02070892b0450aed255c313731cbdda32d15cd99","ja":"それと莉緒さん、相談なんですけど……\n違うアプローチを試してみてもいいですか？","zh":"另外，莉绪小姐，我想和您商量一件事……\n可以试试不同的方法吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_919.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"61cd51b1954f50885ac861e8c647474b13b8657ac046ee079e32d0af80ba606b","ja":"え？　それは構わないけど……。\nでも曲の後ろで流れる映像だから、そこまで……。","zh":"诶？那倒是没关系……  \n不过毕竟是歌曲播放时的背景影像，也没必要做到那种程度……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_919.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"3652dbaabd7f5fc9a1b263bf827b95cfbf9d4e62cbb45e4f7af17148bcd1758b","ja":"いいえ！　台詞が聞こえない演技だからこそ、\nいろいろ試してみた方がいいと思います！","zh":"不是！正因为这是听不见台词的表演，我觉得更应该多尝试各种方式！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_919.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"9eb176941b37b95c5c12061c4dd4d43e1634394661c5684d22d39246151c47a9","ja":"レッスンが始まるまで時間がありませんね……。\nもう一度、お願いします！","zh":"距离课程开始没多少时间了呢……\n再来一次，拜托了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_919.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"f361ccc9ef0c14399b11d0bdcab7ee2bfba92516aec32e0b53d45703c80549f6","ja":"う、うん。分かったよ！","zh":"嗯、嗯。知道了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
